<title>UK: Eutelsat sets 150 million Ecu Eurobond due 2001. [CORRECTED 16:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>Eutelsat sets 150 million Ecu Eurobond due 2001. [CORRECTED 16:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUTELSAT</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN ECU   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    12.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.293   PAY DATE   L11.MAR.97</p>
<p> (Corrects issue price from 101.318 to 101.293.)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.893    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	CONVERTIBLE INTO EURO ON BASIS OF 1 ECU = 1 EURO</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
